OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fwet during the first half of the
OL,7,Fnight, with strong, blustery winds.
OL,8,FClear and dry during the second half
OL,9,Fof the night, but remaining windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FAnother windy day, but
OL,12,Fremaining dry in most places, with
OL,13,Fsome sunny spells. The wind will be
OL,14,Fparticularly strong along the coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,17,FRemaining breezy in the coming days,
OL,18,Fwith bands of rain on Monday and
OL,19,FTuesday, followed by sunny spells and
OL,20,Fshowers. A drier and more settled day
OL,21,Foverall by Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
